    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a\u00a0Adventure told from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of this title is &quot;Morality and freedom&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a dull middle-aged man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While watching the daily news, he found an ad looking for someone to set up a venue for a magic show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He accepts the job and heads to the setup site, where he meets a shady magician...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>POINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel in which you progress through the story by reading the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a topic from the options and enjoy a conversation with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title's play time is about 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please read the guidelines on the official website regarding streaming the play video of this work.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a\u00a0Adventure told from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of this title is &quot;Morality and freedom&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a dull middle-aged man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While watching the daily news, he found an ad looking for someone to set up a venue for a magic show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He accepts the job and heads to the setup site, where he meets a shady magician...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>POINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel in which you progress through the story by reading the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a topic from the options and enjoy a conversation with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title's play time is about 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please read the guidelines on the official website regarding streaming the play video of this work.</p>",
